sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Flutter)
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant AS as Article Service
    participant GenAI as Google GenAI
    participant TTS as Gemini TTS
    participant Store as MinIO/GCS
    participant DB as Article DB

    U->>GW: POST /article/podcast-jobs
    GW->>GW: Verify JWT
    GW->>AS: Proxy (article_ids list)
    AS->>DB: Create article_podcast_job (status=queued)
    AS-->>U: job_id (queued)

    Note over AS: Background Worker
    AS->>DB: Load article snapshots
    AS->>GenAI: Research + summarize articles
    GenAI-->>AS: Summary
    AS->>GenAI: Generate podcast script
    GenAI-->>AS: Script text
    AS->>TTS: Generate audio from script
    TTS-->>AS: Audio bytes
    AS->>Store: Upload audio file
    Store-->>AS: audio_url
    AS->>Store: Upload transcript
    Store-->>AS: transcript_url
    AS->>DB: Update job (status=completed, audio_url, transcript_url)

    U->>GW: GET /article/podcast-jobs/{job_id}
    GW->>AS: Proxy request
    AS->>DB: Query job + assets
    AS-->>U: Job detail (audio_url, transcript_url, status)
